	"Description": "First-pass alert triage operator. On alert fire it investigates in parallel -- reading the alert definition and its firing history, pulling ground truth about the entities out of the raw data, baselining the behaviour against history, and checking runbooks and platform health -- then writes a Markdown triage report with a verdict, the evidence, and validated Gravwell queries the responder should run to get oriented. Automated and read-only; the alert payload is the input message.",
